---
/**
 * Social glyphs, keyed by the same names the config uses.
 *
 * Kept as one lookup so the footer never has to know which platforms exist —
 * it iterates `derived.socialLinks` (built from config) and asks for a glyph
 * by key. A platform with no URL in config produces no link and no icon;
 * there is no `href="#"` path, which is how the old footer shipped a dead
 * Facebook button.
 */
